-Freebuff ships starter templates: complete, designed, working projects (Vite, React and Tailwind on a Cloudflare Worker, ready for Sites). template_list has the current set; it covers things like marketing and landing pages, CRM-style dashboards, storefronts, portfolios, study or flashcard apps and an AI chat assistant, and the app templates already wire Sign in with Freebuff, D1 and R2.
+Freebuff ships starter templates: complete, designed, working projects. template_list has the current set; it covers things like marketing and landing pages, CRM-style dashboards, storefronts, portfolios, study or flashcard apps, an AI chat assistant and games. The template's description and README specify its hosting requirements and integrations. Most website templates are Cloudflare Workers ready for Sites; game templates may need their own server.
 
